   <H1>[Python-Dev] Accepting PEP 572, Assignment Expressions</H1>
    <B>Guido van Rossum</B> 
    <A HREF="mailto:python-dev%40python.org?Subject=Re%3A%20%5BPython-Dev%5D%20Accepting%20PEP%20572%2C%20Assignment%20Expressions&In-Reply-To=%3CCAP7%2BvJJ%3DHBhzDhDsFVXcCvNG4js37Z7xiMMCpJiPbsF13oaoVw%40mail.gmail.com%3E"
